# Lenovo Keyboard Pack for Spinel (TB371FC): function-row keys that the cover's
# driver reports through the separate "keyboard_wakeup_devices" input device.
# Scancodes from getevent; labels from stock ZUI's Lenovo key section, mapped to
# AOSP keycodes where one exists. The rest are left unmapped so they reach the
# device KeyHandler as KEYCODE_UNKNOWN with their scancode.

key 116   POWER

key 640   SLEEP              # lock screen
key 642   META_LEFT          # Windows-position key -> Android Action key (ZUI: language switch)
# key 643   mic mute                  (KeyHandler)
# key 644   touchpad on/off           (KeyHandler)
# key 646   full screen app           (KeyHandler)
# key 647   split screen              (KeyHandler)
# key 649   Lenovo Super Connect      (KeyHandler)
# key 650   App1 shortcut             (KeyHandler)
# key 651   App2 shortcut             (KeyHandler)
